## Summary

Task 9 functionally wires Host composition, shared policy, and runtime-mode reporting as intended. Builds, targeted tests, Godot export, and both headless smoke runs pass independently.

Under strict adversarial reading of the plan, two issues remain:
1. ComposeProjection is inserted between ComposeWorld and ComposeCommand, violating the exact stated order Resource -> SceneFlow -> Ecs -> World -> Command -> Ui.
2. The smoke logs do not enumerate six composed services; they only assert that composition activated.

Both issues are correctable with small changes to Host.cs (reorder and add per-service log lines) or by formally amending the plan/acceptance criteria.

Therefore the independent verification verdict is: needs-fix.
